Command (successful registration):
$body = @{ username = 'routecheck_user'; password = 'testpass' } | ConvertTo-Json -Compress; $body | curl.exe -i -X POST http://localhost:5000/register -H "Content-Type: application/json" --data-binary '@-'

Output (HTTP 201):
{"message":"User successfully registered."}

Repeat the same command to check duplicate handling (HTTP 409):
{"message":"User already exists."}

Missing credentials response (HTTP 400):
{"message":"Username and password are required."}
